[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 122.709, "timestamp": "00:02:02", "text": "好的。我想我們只需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 125.03, "timestamp": "00:02:05", "text": "等它亮起來就行了。等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 128.1, "timestamp": "00:02:08", "text": "那邊好像有東西。確實如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 131.67, "timestamp": "00:02:11", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 133.43, "timestamp": "00:02:13", "text": "注意你的體力。它可以救你一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 135.99, "timestamp": "00:02:15", "text": "命。所以，請確保你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 140.15, "timestamp": "00:02:20", "text": "正確管理了它。好的。關於實體八。喔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 144.39, "timestamp": "00:02:24", "text": "不，這是人類和狗狗那種東西。  我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 152.309, "timestamp": "00:02:32", "text": "一隻非常奇怪又可愛的生物從"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 159.27, "timestamp": "00:02:39", "text": "後面房間裡的鴨子堆裡鑽了出來。它是一種心理上的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 161.43, "timestamp": "00:02:41", "text": "它是一種生理上與"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 164.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:02:44", "text": "鴨子相似但具有類人特徵的生物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 166.63, "timestamp": "00:02:46", "text": "它似乎以極具"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 168.55, "timestamp": "00:02:48", "text": "攻擊性和危險性而聞名，但它卻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 171.91, "timestamp": "00:02:51", "text": "很怕噪音，也很害怕直視對方的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 174.309, "timestamp": "00:02:54", "text": "眼睛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 176.63, "timestamp": "00:02:56", "text": "當你看著它的臉，你會發現它看起來很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 179.27, "timestamp": "00:02:59", "text": "聰明。有些時候，"}]